    "text": "Shapes\n\nThe 🌊 harbour was quiet when the boats came in. Café lights burned 𝒶ll night.\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"tide\");\n\n        let  x = 1;\n}\n\nA rope,  coiled twice."
